sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Browser as Stillpoint in browser
    participant IDB as IndexedDB
    participant CDN as Vercel CDN
    participant API as Next.js catalog routes
    participant Neon as Neon Postgres
    participant Cron as Vercel Cron
    participant DS as Dharma Seed

    rect rgb(244, 248, 252)
        Note over User,Neon: Device load and incremental synchronization
        User->>Browser: Open the app
        Browser->>IDB: Read talks, teachers, and local editions
        IDB-->>Browser: Return the durable device catalog
        Browser-->>User: Offer listening immediately when cached data exists
        Browser->>CDN: GET index with local edition
        alt CDN hit
            CDN-->>Browser: Changed and removed IDs plus hosted edition
        else CDN miss
            CDN->>API: Forward catalog request
            API->>Neon: Read state and version delta
            Neon-->>API: Index response
            API-->>CDN: Cacheable JSON
            CDN-->>Browser: Index response
            opt Hosted data is older than 24 hours
                API->>API: Schedule refresh after the response
            end
        end
        loop Detail batches of at most 500 IDs
            Browser->>CDN: GET details with target snapshot
            alt CDN hit
                CDN-->>Browser: Versioned details
            else CDN miss
                CDN->>API: Forward detail request
                API->>Neon: Read requested fields by ID
                Neon-->>API: Versioned details and removals
                API-->>CDN: Long-lived cacheable JSON
                CDN-->>Browser: Versioned details
            end
            Browser->>IDB: Upsert and remove, then checkpoint progress
        end
        Browser->>IDB: Commit local edition and clear checkpoint
        User->>Browser: Play a selected recording
        Browser->>DS: Stream audio directly
    end

    rect rgb(252, 248, 240)
        Note over Cron,DS: Shared catalog refresh, separate from device synchronization
        alt Daily schedule
            Cron->>API: GET protected refresh endpoint
        else Stale-read safety net
            API->>API: Start scheduled background refresh
        end
        API->>Neon: Try to acquire the refresh lease
        alt Lease acquired
            Neon-->>API: Current source editions and hosted version
            API->>DS: Fetch talk and teacher edition deltas
            DS-->>API: Changed indexes and bounded details
            API->>Neon: Atomically publish both resources and tombstones
            Neon-->>API: New last known-good hosted version
        else Refresh already running or backing off
            Neon-->>API: No lease, keep serving the active version
        end
    end
